  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Intergovernmental Panel  on Climate Change (IPCC) 2025-28</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A contribution of DKK 10 mil. for the period 2025-2028 is provided to the IPCC Trust Fund to strengthen the scientific base for climate action through the involvement of experts from developing countries and emerging economies in the preparation of several reports as part of its seventh assessment cycle. 
This will culminate in the publication of the IPCC&apos;s 7th Assessment Report (AR7), which will support decision-makers and other actors in defining and implementing the climate action needed to implement the objectives of the Paris Agreement and the Climate Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
